    <question_explanation no="15" id="PRB-E0CEC77F8A2A11EE-Q15">
      <question_stem>자계 ${\vec{H}} = 0 . 1 \sin ( 10^{3} t + 10^{2} y ) {\vec{a_{z}}}$ [A/m]인 자유공간의 원점에서 시간 $t = 0$일 때, 변위전류밀도[A/m^(2)]는?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>자계</keyword>
        <keyword>자유공간</keyword>
        <keyword>원점에서</keyword>
        <keyword>시간</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>1</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>$10 {\vec{a_{x}}}$</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 전기자기학 · 변위전류밀도
정답은 ①이다. 자유공간에서 전도전류가 없으므로 Jd = ∂D/∂t = ∇ × H이다. H = Hz(y, t)az이므로 ∇ × H = (∂Hz/∂y)ax = 0.1 × 10² cos(10³t + 10²y)ax이다. 원점, t = 0에서 Jd = 10ax[A/m²]이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>$10 {\vec{a_{x}}}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>10ax이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$10 {\vec{a_{y}}}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>방향이 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$10 {\vec{a_{z}}}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>방향이 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$0$</choice_text>
